+# Corpus fetching
+
+## Observed per-domain rate limit
+
+The repository records that fetching was rate-limited, but it does not record the
+number of visits allowed per window, the window length, or the cooldown imposed after
+a breach. Those values therefore cannot be recovered from the checked-in corpus
+metadata and are intentionally not guessed here.
+
+## File hosts
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` — the corpus manifest explicitly says that the files
+  were fetched raw through this host.
+
+No other CDN or mirror host used to fetch the corpus files is recorded in the
+repository. `grep.app` is mentioned as the code-search service used to locate the
+files, not as a host from which the files themselves were fetched.
